// DEFECT 10, found in review -- two of the three deposition figures faced
// AWAY from the table they are deposing over. The table spans z -0.93..0.93
// and _loadAvatarSeat gives every non-elevated seat rotation.y = PI (facing
// -Z), which is right for the witness at z = +1.0 and exactly backwards for
// both counsel at z = -1.0. The deposition camera looks at the table from
// (+-2.0, 1.5, 0.6), so it framed the backs of two heads out of three.
